# `.env*`, not `.env`: the exact-match pattern left `.env.demo` — which holds the
# demo deployment's database passwords, session secret and Cloudflare tunnel token —
# perfectly committable. The template is re-included below.
.env*
!.env.demo.example
.venv/
.vercel/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
reference/
graphify-out/
**/graphify-out/
eval/results.md
